    <body>
        <h1>Privacy Policy for Tile Tale</h1>
        <p class="meta">Last Updated: April 28, 2026</p>

        <p>
            Tile Tale ("we," "us," or "our") is committed to protecting your
            privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and
            disclose information when you play Tile Tale.
        </p>

        <h3>1. Information We Collect Automatically</h3>
        <p>
            When you use the app, we collect certain information automatically
            through third-party services:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Identifiers:</strong> We collect device identifiers
                (such as the IDFA for advertising and IDFV for vendor tracking)
                and service-specific identifiers (such as your Game Center ID).
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Usage Data:</strong> We collect information about your
                interactions with the app, including puzzle progress, gameplay
                events (moves, undos, hints), and session duration.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Diagnostics:</strong> We collect crash reports and
                performance data to help us improve the app's stability.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Purchases:</strong> We collect your purchase history to
                manage in-app purchases and restore items. Payment details are
                handled securely by Apple and are never shared with us.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>2. Third-Party Services</h3>
        <p>
            We use the following third-party services that may collect data in
            accordance with their own privacy policies:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Google AdMob:</strong> Used to display advertisements.
                AdMob may use device identifiers to serve personalized ads.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Firebase Analytics:</strong> Used to understand how
                players use the game.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Apple Game Center:</strong> Used for leaderboards,
                achievements, and multiplayer features.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Apple CloudKit:</strong> Used to sync your game progress
                across your devices.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3. Tracking and App Tracking Transparency (ATT)</h3>
        <p>
            On iOS, we will ask for your permission to track you across apps and
            websites owned by other companies. If you decline, AdMob will serve
            non-personalized ads, and your data will not be used for targeted
            advertising.
        </p>

        <h3>4. Children's Privacy</h3>
        <p>
            Tile Tale is a general audience game. We do not knowingly collect
            personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have
            inadvertently collected such information, please contact us so we
            can delete it.
        </p>

        <h3>5. Data Retention</h3>
        <p>
            We do not operate our own database servers. Your game progress is
            stored on your device and in your private Apple iCloud account via
            CloudKit. Analytics and advertising data are stored by Google and
            Apple according to their respective retention policies.
        </p>

        <h3>6. Your Rights</h3>
        <p>You can manage your data in the following ways:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>iCloud Data:</strong> You can delete your game data
                through your iOS Settings under iCloud.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Advertising:</strong> You can reset your Advertising
                Identifier or limit tracking in your iOS Privacy settings.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Analytics:</strong> You can opt-out of collection within
                the app settings (if provided) or by disabling tracking.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>7. Contact Us</h3>
        <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
            us at:
        </p>
        <p>
            <a href="mailto:clamor.aneroid-7c@icloud.com"
                >clamor.aneroid-7c@icloud.com</a
            >
        </p>
